W05 adaptations of W06 PR #36 (71daf010a4), applied at build time only (build.sh); the W06
source is otherwise unchanged. All are defects that stop the W06 role agents from working
when hosted as written; to be fixed upstream by W06.

1. MaterialAgentFactory.build() creates the snapshot store but never loads it (no call to
   SnapshotStore.load() anywhere in the W06 source) and the store is a local variable the
   wrapper cannot reach. Without the load every read_page call answers "快照中没有第 N 页".

2. MetricAgentFactory's system prompt contains a literal "%" ("亿元/% 等") and is passed
   through String.formatted(keys), which throws UnknownFormatConversionException ("Conversion
   = ' '") while the agent is built: the metrics agent cannot start. Escaping it as "%%"
   renders exactly the text W06 wrote.

3. The ask_user tool card in the metrics, operation, asset-quality and writer factories has no
   inputParams, so the model API rejects every request of these agents ("tools.N.function.
   parameters must be a JSON Schema of type object", HTTP 400) before any reasoning. Giving it the
   same empty object schema W06 already uses for list_metrics_index fixes it; the tool body is
   unchanged (it only returns the AskUserRail placeholder).

--- a/agents/src/main/java/com/agenthub/w06/agents/material/MaterialAgentFactory.java
+++ b/agents/src/main/java/com/agenthub/w06/agents/material/MaterialAgentFactory.java
@@ -51,6 +51,7 @@
     public static ReActAgent build(MaterialAgentProperties props, Path snapshotDir) {
         props.requireConfigured();
         SnapshotStore store = new SnapshotStore(snapshotDir);
+        store.load();

         ReActAgentConfig config = ReActAgentConfig.builder()
                 .maxIterations(props.getMaxIterations())
